 position vector $p$ of the intersection point $P,$ we substitute $t=-3$ into the equation of the line:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p & =⟨3+5(-3),1+2(-3),-4+3(-3)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-12,-5,-13⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we get $P(-12,-5,-13).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399651 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399652 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399651 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399653 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399651 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399654 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399651 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399655 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399651 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399656 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399651 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399651 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399651 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186399654 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399651 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "3cd4a0b3-55ce-54d3-98c8-8b7021d46e30" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399652 #edb/ref 1080 "(13,7,2)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399652 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399652 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c181d54f-7b5e-5e40-b660-5db606239a3a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399653 #edb/ref 1080 "(8,3,-1)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399653 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399653 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7c2c2f01-60e6-5197-ae47-76dd272575a0" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
